        {tab==='land'&&result&&<><p>Gross {f(result.land.gross)} = physical lot allocations (all statuses) {f(result.land.residential)} + unioned internal roads {f(result.land.roads)} + protected envelopes {f(result.land.protected)} + flexible space {f(result.land.flexible)} + other reservations {f(result.land.reservations)} + residual {f(result.land.residual)} m².</p><p>Overlap: {f(result.land.overlap,4)} m². Gap: {f(result.land.gap,4)} m². Tolerance: {result.land.tolerance} m². External roads are excluded from internal road quantities; any existing ROW inside the site is an other reservation. Buffer envelopes reserve physical land; their original features remain visible.</p><p>Priced development: Rp {f(result.cost,0)}. Per-lot rates apply only to current valid counts. {result.missingCosts.join(' · ')}. Missing rates remain unpriced.</p>{result.overlays?.map(o=><p key={o.id}>Functional overlay {reportInputs.spaces.find(s=>s.id===o.id)?.name}: {f(o.area)} m², already included in the physical partition.</p>)}<h3>Residual assessment</h3>{result.residualRegions?.map(region=><p key={region.id}>{region.id}: {f(region.area)} m² · {region.status} · {region.reason}</p>)}<p>{reportInputs.fill?'Permitted frontage/depth variation tested.':'Nominal lots tested; use Fill permitted residual to test minimum permitted dimensions.'} {Object.entries(result.skipped).map(([reason,n])=>`${n} rejected candidates: ${reason}`).join(' · ')}. Counts are tested positions, not estimates of additional capacity. No global impossibility claim.</p><button onClick={()=>{if(draft.fill){setStatus('Current layout already includes the supported residual-fill trials. Inspect the residual assessment and rejected candidates; no additional fit has been demonstrated.');}else change(i=>{i.fill=true;});}}>Fill permitted residual</button></>}
        {tab==='issues'&&result&&<><p>{result.qualified?'Qualifies under implemented checks.':'Not qualified under all recorded inputs/checks.'} Rigid-body screening uses only the declared inputs. Detailed vehicle manoeuvres, house design and approvals require separate checks.</p>{result.screening?.filter(x=>x.state==='pass').map((x,k)=><p key={`screen_${k}`} className="res-pass">PASS · {x.object}: {x.message}</p>)}{result.issues.map((x,k)=><p key={k} className={x.state==='fail'?'res-fail':'res-unknown'}>{x.state.toUpperCase()} · {x.object}: {x.message}</p>)}{!result.issues.length&&<p>Implemented geometry and entered mandatory mix checks pass.</p>}</>}
